{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">It\u00b4s time for another shot of Adrenaline with the introduction of one of the most extravagant forms of motorsports ever seen any time, anywhere - weighing just 1400kg and delivering over 600 HP the <strong>Super Trophy Trucks</strong> hustle through road and street courses filled with jumping ramps making for some insane air time and spectacular action!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Super Trophy Trucks (STT for short) are the exclusive class of this pack, which also includes 12-dedicated ramp-filled track layouts:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Adelaide</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Cleveland</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Guapor\u00e9</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hockenheimring</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Ibarra</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Long Beach</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Monza</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Road America</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Sebring</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Spielberg</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Velopark</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Watkins Glen</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Adrenaline Pt2 is still part of the original Season Pass and the Premium Expansion Packs, so if you own either of these DLCs you will receive the Super Trophy Trucks with no additional charge.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2518760?t=1742484587","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2518760/88c15178f9c44fc49bb0bb122cf23cdbf9544591/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1742484587","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2518760/31e2cba2eb6e858de0a45d20d7a8389e55fbc0b1/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1742484587","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_ass